<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, minimal-ui">
    <title>Covering Letter</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/wdi-30-ldn/portfolio/favicon-32x32.png" sizes="32x32" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/wdi-30-ldn/portfolio/favicon-16x16.png" sizes="16x16" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.2.0/css/all.min.css" integrity="sha512-xh6O/CkQoPOWDdYTDqeRdPCVd1SpvCA9XXcUnZS2FmJNp1coAFzvtCN9BmamE+4aHK8yyUHUSCcJHgXloTyT2A==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../styles/main.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main id="covering-letter" class="page left-border">
      {{> covering-letter-header}}
      {{#coveringLetter.company}}

        <div class="covering-letter-content">
          <p>Dear {{hiringManager.name}},</p>

          <p>I am writing to express my interest in the {{position}} position{{#if companyKnown}} within the Design Systems team at {{name}}{{/if}}. I’m a frontend-focused engineer with over eight years’ experience building scalable, high-traffic web applications for large audiences.
            After spending the past three years working in New Zealand, I am relocating back to London and am seeking an opportunity to contribute to a product-focused engineering team.</p>

          <p>During my time at ITV as a Core Frontend Engineer, I contributed to the development of a TypeScript-based Atomic Design System used across Web and Connected TV platforms. This involved building reusable UI components, supporting design system adoption across teams, and maintaining high standards for accessibility and performance in a large-scale streaming environment.</p>

          <p>I value collaboration and psychological safety within engineering teams. I’ve mentored junior engineers through pairing and structured feedback, and previously taught over 100 students as a JavaScript instructor at General Assembly. I enjoy helping others grow, sharing knowledge, and contributing to environments where quality and kindness go hand in hand.</p>

          {{#if examples}}
            <p>Highlights of my experience include:</p>
            <ul>
              {{#each examples}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{/each}}
            </ul>
          {{/if}}

          {{!-- {{#if reasonsWhyCompany}}
            <p>
              {{#each reasonsWhyCompany}}{{.}} {{/each}}
            </p>
          {{/if}} --}}

          <p>I’m particularly drawn to this role because of its focus on design system stewardship, collaboration with designers, and building solid frontend foundations that empower multiple teams. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute my UI expertise, mentoring experience, and commitment to thoughtful engineering to Nando’s Design System team.
            Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to speak further.</p>

          <p>Sincerely,</p>

          <p>Wilson Espina</p>

          <br/>

        </div>
      {{/coveringLetter.company}}
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
